<article class="ac-public-section" data-ac-page-section="public-solutions">
  <header class="ac-public-page-header">
    <h1>Solutions</h1>
    <p class="ac-public-lede">ActiveClinic supports clinic operations, public discovery, and patient booking requests — with clear labels for what is available today versus pilot or planned work.</p>
  </header>

  <section class="ac-public-section" data-ac-solutions-section="operations">
    <h2>Clinic operations</h2>
    <div class="ac-capability-grid">
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Patient management</h3>
        <p>Register and search patients, manage profiles, and support reception workflows inside the secure app.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Appointments</h3>
        <p>Schedule and track visits for staff. Public requests feed into clinic review — not automatic confirmation.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Facilities &amp; staff</h3>
        <p>Configure locations, roles, and staff directory entries for your organisation.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--pilot">Pilot</span>
        <h3>Clinical documentation</h3>
        <p>Foundational clinical UI for enrolled pilot organisations. Not exposed on the public website.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ac-public-section ac-public-section--alt" data-ac-solutions-section="public-presence">
    <h2>Public presence</h2>
    <div class="ac-capability-grid">
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Clinic directory listing</h3>
        <p>Opt-in visibility on the ActiveClinic platform directory when your organisation publishes.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Tenant public website</h3>
        <p>Branded pages for home, about, services, doctors, contact, and policies.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Contact inquiries</h3>
        <p>Patients can send messages to clinics that enable public contact forms.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--planned">Planned</span>
        <h3>Pricing pages</h3>
        <p>Structured service pricing display when clinics provide verified price data.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ac-public-section" data-ac-solutions-section="booking">
    <h2>Patient booking</h2>
    <div class="ac-capability-grid">
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--available">Available</span>
        <h3>Consultation requests</h3>
        <p>Patients submit preferred times and visit reasons. Clinics respond with confirmed times.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--pilot">Pilot</span>
        <h3>Procedure requests</h3>
        <p>Request procedures with preparation acknowledgements where clinics enable them.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--pilot">Pilot</span>
        <h3>My booking lookup</h3>
        <p>Check request status with a secure link — no login required for basic lookup.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ac-capability-card">
        <span class="ac-capability-badge ac-capability-badge--planned">Planned</span>
        <h3>Real-time slot selection</h3>
        <p>Live availability calendars require clinic-configured schedules — not a platform guarantee today.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ac-public-section ac-public-privacy-note">
    <h2>Honest product boundaries</h2>
    <p>ActiveClinic does not provide medical records access on this website, does not auto-provision clinics from registration forms, and does not send SMS or WhatsApp confirmations unless explicitly enabled and integrated. Counts of clinics or patients are not displayed unless sourced from live directory data.</p>
  </section>

  <section class="ac-public-section ac-public-final-cta">
    <h2>See it in action</h2>
    <p class="ac-public-actions">
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--primary" href="/clinics">Browse clinics</a>
      <a class="ac-btn ac-btn--secondary" href="/register-clinic">Apply to join</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</article>
